{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05427","headline":"徵君宅 · 许景先","name":"徵君宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"徵君昔嘉遯，抗迹遗俗尘。\n了心悟有物，乘化游无垠。\n道丧历千载，复存颍阳真。\n上虞佳山水，晚岁耽隐沦。\n内史既解绶，支公亦相亲。\n儒道匪远理，意胜聊自欣。\n洄沿南谿夕，流浪东山春。\n石壁践丹景，金潭冒绿苹。\n探链备海峤，赏心寓情人。\n奈何灵仙骨，锹翮瑶池津。\n寥寥虚白宇，夙剏招提因。\n家风缅多尚，玄德谢无邻。\n谬陪金门彦，矫迹侍紫宸。\n皇恩竟已矣，遗烈庶不泯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许景先","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}